description:
Compute or validate the GS1 mod-10 check digit of an EAN-8, UPC-A, EAN-13 or ITF-14 (GTIN-8/12/13/14) number. Give the digits without the check digit to compute it, or the full code to validate it.

Returns: JSON { digits, checkDigit, fullCode, valid, gtin14, formats[] }. valid is true/false when a full code was checked and null when the check digit was computed.
Example input: {"code":"400638133393","mode":"compute"}
